# Code owners
#
# These paths require explicit human review on every PR. Most importantly:
# the agentic monitoring loop should never modify its own guardrails through
# an auto-fix. Locking these paths ensures any change to detection, fix
# allowlist, or workflow definitions hits a human merge gate even when
# branch protection is on with auto-merge.

# Agentic monitoring — entire scope locked
/scripts/agents/                @jmshoe
/.github/workflows/agents-*.yml @jmshoe
/docs/agents/                   @jmshoe

# CI / repo plumbing
/.github/workflows/ci.yml       @jmshoe
/.github/CODEOWNERS             @jmshoe

# Hard build-time guards (URL canonical form, blog validation)
/src/lib/config.ts              @jmshoe
/scripts/setup-db.ts            @jmshoe
